{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "month": "2026-09",
  "version": "6fb7e2d5364f",
  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "2026-09-17",
      "date": "2026-09-17",
      "text": "我心里有一簇迎着烈日而生的花，比一切美酒都要芬芳，滚烫的馨香淹没过稻草人的胸膛，草扎的精神，从此万寿无疆。",
      "author": "priest",
      "source": "默读",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "collage",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 1,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/8biCMw.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-29-bf7fd01a1797.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-09-18",
      "date": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "东风!红旗!朝霞似锦大道!青天!鲜花如云。",
      "author": "贺敬之",
      "source": "贺敬之诗选",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "horizon",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 1,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/YP5pBA.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/mountain-path-8f42fd7e84d1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-09-19",
      "date": "2026-09-19",
      "text": "你在桥上看风景，看风景人在楼上看你。 明月装饰了你的窗子，你装饰了别人的梦。",
      "author": "卞之琳",
      "source": "断章",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "photo",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 1,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/KSIqEw.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-36-b3a422a3f8d0.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-09-20",
      "date": "2026-09-20",
      "text": "青春的每一天都是很贵重的！",
      "author": "东云名乃",
      "source": "日常",
      "category": "动漫",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "collage",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 1,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/VI4wbQ.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-06-b0f43fbd1ce4.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-09-21",
      "date": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "我娶你来不是让你来做家务事的，你就坐着呆着，不想写诗不想读书不想操琴，就听风看云晒太阳。",
      "author": "柳如是",
      "source": "柳如是",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "split",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 1,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/tRTGdw.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-12-55786b92929b.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-09-22",
      "date": "2026-09-22",
      "text": "自能窥宋玉，\n何必恨王昌。",
      "author": "鱼玄机",
      "source": "赠邻女",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "vertical",
      "font": "mashanzheng",
      "revision": 1,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/89n6GQ.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-1793794949153-b342b5bf60b6.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-09-23",
      "date": "2026-09-23",
      "text": "一个人不想攀高就不怕下跌，也不用倾轧排挤，可以保其天真，成其自然，潜心一志完成自己能做的事。",
      "author": "杨绛",
      "source": "将饮茶",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "type",
      "font": "xiaowei",
      "revision": 1,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/xp335g.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-13-685086481a18.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-09-24",
      "date": "2026-09-24",
      "text": "我会死在这里，我的每一寸肌肤都会腐烂，除了…一寸，这一寸，它是那么的小，那么的脆弱，却是这世上唯一值得拥有的东西，我们决不能失去或者放弃它，我们决不能让别人把它夺走。",
      "author": "盖伊",
      "source": "碧之轨迹",
      "category": "动漫",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "poster",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 1,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/aXaoUQ.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-09-3dc122da8f7c.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-09-25",
      "date": "2026-09-25",
      "text": "我们每个人都是往事的幸存者，最终学会的，都是如何和自己相处。",
      "author": "卢思浩",
      "source": "《时间的答案》",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "excerpt",
      "font": "xiaowei",
      "revision": 1,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/Sax5ZA.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-01-6ec68b9d0eff.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-09-26",
      "date": "2026-09-26",
      "text": "此地有崇山峻岭，茂林修竹，又有清流激揣，映带左右，引以为流觞曲水，列坐其次，虽无丝竹管弦为盛，一觞一咏，亦足以畅叙幽情。",
      "author": "吴楚材",
      "source": "古文观止",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "paper",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 1,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/IfWbXg.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-30-1dd8655c9a80.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-09-27",
      "date": "2026-09-27",
      "text": "其实最棒的回忆就在当下，在眼前，而且这会是人生最美好的时光。",
      "author": "马克·李维",
      "source": "偷影子的人",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "letter",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 1,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/kwlpkA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-02-8eeef28d2a41.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-09-28",
      "date": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "区区二人深谷相阻断，幽幽无底欲渡亦枉然，浅浅思索追忆上眉间，迢迢旧地共望群星灿。",
      "author": "Barbarian On The Groove/茶太",
      "source": "G弦上的魔王",
      "category": "游戏",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "light",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 1,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/2cQIzg.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-17-383a010c7bc2.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-09-29",
      "date": "2026-09-29",
      "text": "在隆冬，我终于知道，我身上有一个不可战胜的夏天。",
      "author": "加缪",
      "source": "夏天集",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "letter",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 1,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/Mu6FGw.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-05-ef4a815dabf1.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-09-30",
      "date": "2026-09-30",
      "text": "……让才能能真正开花结果的机会也许就在今天，又或者是明天、后天，又或者是明年。",
      "author": "及川彻",
      "source": "排球少年",
      "category": "动漫",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "collage",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 1,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/kwlpkA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-02-8eeef28d2a41.png"
    }
  ]
}
